"""Built-in Simkl client id (optional).

Simkl is offered in Settings only when a client id is available here or in
the DOPEIPTV_SIMKL_CLIENT_ID environment variable. To ship one:

  1. Copy this file to  dopeiptv/_simkl_key.py  (git-ignored), or
  2. export DOPEIPTV_SIMKL_CLIENT_ID=<the client id>  before running, or
  3. for release builds, set a SIMKL_CLIENT_ID GitHub Actions secret so it
     is baked into the packaged artifacts without ever touching git.

The client id is that of dopeIPTV's own app at https://simkl.com/settings/developer/
(the PIN sign-in needs no client secret, and none is used).

The real id is deliberately never committed to the public repository.
"""

SIMKL_CLIENT_ID = ""
